<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-NADAL PULLS OUT OF SPANISH SQUAD FOR CZECH GAME.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NADAL PULLS OUT OF SPANISH SQUAD FOR CZECH GAME.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barcelona defender Miguel Angel Nadal has pulled out of the Spanish squad for Sunday's vital World Cup qualifier with the Czech Republic because of injury. He will be replaced by Atletico Madrid's Juan Lopez.</p>
<p>Spain coach Javier Clemente has already had to bring in striker Ismael Urzaiz for Nadal's club team mate Sergi Barjuan who pulled up in training last week.</p>
